sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Respondent
    participant P as Survey page
    participant A as Hono API
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant FS as Firestore

    opt File question
        P->>A: POST /api/files (multipart file)
        A->>A: re-check type and size (max 700 KB)
        A->>FS: files/{fileId} = name, type, base64
        A-->>P: 201 { id }
    end

    U->>P: Submit answers
    P->>P: zodResolver validates (client)
    P->>A: POST /api/forms/:id/submissions
    A->>PG: load form + questions
    A->>A: buildAnswerSchema(questions) validates body
    alt Invalid
        A-->>P: 400 invalid_answers + issues
    else Unknown file id
        A->>FS: file exists?
        A-->>P: 400 Unknown file
    else Valid
        A->>PG: nested create: Submission + Answers (one transaction)
        PG-->>A: saved row
        A->>FS: transaction: set submission, responseCount +1 only if new
        Note over A,FS: a Firestore failure is logged, not returned
        A-->>P: 201 { id }
    end